ols.With this demo, users can try creating their own P2D maps, explore a variety of visual effects, and preview walking animations. Map data can be saved and will carry over to the full version of RPG Maker U2U, once it releases. Download the demo below and try it out today! Plea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:58:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035922","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:27:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856440-1847286114035874","game_id":"steam-4856440","kind":"announcement","title":"“Let's make some P2D maps!” — Event Information","summary":"To celebrate the release of the P2D Map Editor Demo, we’re inviting everyone to join our community map-sharing event, “Let's make some P2D maps!”This is a celebration of your creativity, with no judging or rankings—just a chance to enjoy and share the maps you dream up!To participate, post a screenshot of a P2D map you’ve created with the demo in this Steam Community Hub thread.Event DetailsEvent Name: Let's make some P2D maps!Submission Period: Tuesday, October 20 – Monday, November 16, 2026 (J","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:39:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035874","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:27:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856440-1846651706693638","game_id":"steam-4856440","kind":"announcement","title":"Easier To Use & More Expressive: A Look At New Functions in RPG MAKER U2U","summary":"Hello everyone, RPG MAKER U2U Producer Ichinose here again. Thank you for your continued interest in RPG MAKER U2U’s development! As RPG MAKER U2U continues the RPG Maker tradition of being easy, we’re also working on brand new features for U2U. In this Producer Letter let’s take a look at 3 things all related to improving the creation process surrounding P2D map quality and refinement.１．Confirm Your Maps: Map Preview The Map Preview function allows creators to quickly check a map without needin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:15:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856440-1845383656392649","game_id":"steam-4856440","kind":"announcement","title":"RPG MAKER U2U: Expanding Games and the Editor With Scripts and Plugins","summary":"Greetings everyone! RPG MAKER U2U producer Ichinose here. We’re really happy seeing all the interest that RPG MAKER U2U has attracted, and we thank you so much for it!In this Producer Letter we’ll introduce the scripting and plugin systems for RPG MAKER U2U, as we have received a lot of requests for more information about them.Of course it’s more than possible to make a great game experience in RPG MAKER U2U without any programming. The information we are sharing today is more about showcasing h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T06:11:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856440-1842212951298526","game_id":"steam-4856440","kind":"announcement","title":"Even Easier to Use: A New Direction For RPG MAKER U2U","summary":"Greetings, everyone! I am Ichinose, the producer for RPG MAKER U2U.When we announced RPG MAKER U2U in May of this year, we received quite a lot of feedback! I thank you for all your passion from the bottom of my heart.Due to all the feedback we received, we have reviewed our development priorities and will be able to make RPG MAKER U2U even better!1. Improving Ease of UseA lot of people expressed concern about what shape RPG MAKER U2U would be distributed in, and those were some particularly imp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T01:19:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4856440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4856440":"2026-10-26T14:51:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4856440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:39Z"},"5222840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:51:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4856440","app_id":4856440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:02Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fc39ffd48a169f88734bda83b3f83c12efc6fc5bcf3e05af8d9501195c99bf33","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"RPG MAKER U2U is the latest entry in the RPG Maker series of easy to use game development tools. With the addition of the new P2D system for adding depth and new light & shadow effects, create world of rich detail and immersion like never before!","publishers":[{"name":" Gotcha Gotcha Games"}],"developers":[{"name":" Gotcha Gotcha Games"}],"franchises":[{"name